-- Source module: Solutions.R6ZMain
/-!
# Round six, chirp: `P18Body6 → chirpG6`

The frozen `KFZMain.chirpNeedR_of_P18` at the round-six sizes: the chirp procedure `body`
(`KFZFull`) is the own procedure of the merged table `mExt4 ext₁₈ ∅ ∅ ∅ [body]` in `kTableP tab`;
the Prop 18 procedure (from `P18Body6`) is reached through `g4₁`. The descriptor stack is
`cS = 36`. Per call `M̃r = mrtCall t F G H` with `H` the Prop 18 result, within `errW6 · 2^{-p}`.

* **`chirp_of_P18`**: one table, entry, constants for all sizes `Q` of the parameters `P` with
  `QOk Q`: the grid tables `θ̃, θ̃⁻, ã, b̃` with their `Phases` facts and `chirpG6`.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false

